    "title": "LFTs not ordered despite abdominal pain",
    "message": "Guidelines state that when TDF-related symptoms such as abdominal pain or discomfort are present, LFTs and RFTs should be performed. The clinician's plan today documents abdominal pain but does not include any laboratory orders. The most recent creatinine (82 umol/L, 78 days ago) is within normal limits, but no liver function tests are on record. The plan lacks any diagnostic workup for the presenting symptom.",
